# mdeai Proof-Driven Delivery System

> **Default:** [`mdeai-workflow.mdc`](./mdeai-workflow.mdc). Load this file for **P0 `phase:launch`**, batch audits, or when user asks for Evidence Score.

**Principle:** A Linear status is never proof. Launch readiness = persona journeys + Evidence Score + runtime proof.

Orchestrates: [`mdeai-task-skill-mcp-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-task-skill-mcp-gate.mdc) · [`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc) · [`mdeai-done-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-done-gate.mdc) · [`mdeai-launch-gate.mdc`](./mdeai-launch-gate.mdc) · [`mdeai-testing.mdc`](./mdeai-testing.mdc) · [`mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc`](./mdeai-live-prod-check.mdc) · skills `task-verifier` · `mde-task-lifecycle` · `run-review` · `check-pr-comments`

