## Level 2 — Evidence Score (replaces naive “Done”)

Track per task — do not trust Linear `Done` without score.

| Category | Weight | What it measures |
|----------|--------|----------------|
| Spec Alignment | 25% | Acceptance criteria match disk + `task-verifier` |
| Tests | 25% | Vitest + Playwright targeted to task |
| Runtime Verification | 20% | `npm run dev` clean + route/API responds |
| Production Proof | 20% | `https://www.mdeai.co/` curl + browser (P0 launch tasks) |
| Process Compliance | 10% | Skills, MCP, cubic/CodeRabbit, one-PR scope, evidence file |

```text
Evidence Score =
  0.25 × Spec + 0.25 × Tests + 0.20 × Runtime + 0.20 × Production + 0.10 × Process
```

| Score | Grade | Linear status |
|-------|-------|---------------|
| 90–100 | A | Eligible for **Done** (user approval still required) |
| 75–89 | B | **In Review** — prod or browser gap |
| 60–74 | C | **In Progress** — runtime/tests gap |
| <60 | F | **Blocked** — do not PR |

Record in evidence + ledger (see Level 3).

