## Level 5 — Browser proof levels (L1–L5)

| Level | Requirement | Tool |
|-------|-------------|------|
| **L1** | Unit tests | Vitest |
| **L2** | E2E automated | Playwright (`e2e/helpers/maps-layout.ts` for hero/chat) |
| **L3** | Interactive localhost | Browser MCP + screenshot |
| **L4** | Production browser | Browser MCP or Playwright on prod |
| **L5** | Full persona journey | Multi-step flow + pins/cards/detail per journey spec |

Record per task: `L1 ✓ L2 ✓ L3 ✓ L4 ✗ L5 ✗` → Status **In Review** until P0 requires L4+.

**P0 launch tasks (`phase:launch`):** minimum **L1 + L2 + L3 + L4**; **L5** for SAN-546 matrix journeys.

### Real-world proof (mandatory — not optional)

Full spec: [`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc) Part A.

**Vitest/curl alone is never sufficient** for persona-visible UI, chat, maps, cards, or agents.

Every such task MUST run **≥1** real-world tool and capture proof:

| Tool | When to use |
|------|-------------|
| **Cursor Browser MCP** | Default — persona prompt, cards, pins, screenshot |
| **Playwright** | Scripted regression; hero/chat via `e2e/helpers/maps-layout.ts` |
| **Chrome DevTools MCP** | Network/console/a11y when Browser fails or for API 401/500 diagnosis |

**Environments (both required unless deploy blocked):**

| Env | URL | Minimum proof |
|-----|-----|---------------|
| **Localhost** | `http://localhost:3001/` (port from `[ui]` log) | Dev restart → GET / 200 → persona prompt → screenshot |
| **Production** | `https://www.mdeai.co/` (alias `https://mdeai.co/`) | Same prompt + screenshot OR `chat-smoke.mjs --base https://www.mdeai.co` |

Evidence row per prompt:

```markdown
| Prompt | Env | Tool | Expected | Actual | Screenshot | Console | Network | PASS |
```

**Chat hero:** use `submitHomeHeroQuery` in `e2e/helpers/maps-layout.ts` — never raw `fill()` (Send stays disabled).

If prod not deployed → **BLOCKED** for L4; do not claim post-merge PASS.

