## Level 6 — Verification stack (mandatory order)

0. **Pre-flight** — Level 0 complete; verdict **PROCEED**; blockers/failure points logged
1. **Skills** (≤5) — same pack as Level 0 (already loaded — re-read if touch surface changed)
2. **MCP docs** — same matrix as Level 0 before any new external API call
3. **Implement** — one SAN per PR; git root `mdeapp/` — **only after pre-flight PROCEED**
4. **L1 Vitest** — targeted tests
5. **L2 Playwright** — task e2e spec
6. **Runtime** — `cd mdeapp && npm run dev` + curl relevant route/API
7. **Real-world localhost** — Browser MCP **or** Playwright **or** Chrome DevTools MCP: persona prompt + screenshot → `tasks/testing/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/`
8. **Real-world prod** — repeat same prompt on `https://www.mdeai.co/` (+ `chat-smoke.mjs`); Chrome DevTools if 401/500/console errors
9. **Deploy gate** — for prod claims: `gh pr view` merged + prod SHA = merge commit
10. **PR review — cubic + CodeRabbit** — **always** before In Review/merge ([`mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc`](./mdeai-real-world-proof-pr-review.mdc) Part B):

    ```bash
    cd /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp
    cr review --agent --base main          # CodeRabbit — pre-PR
    cubic review --base main               # cubic-dev — pre-PR (or cubic review -j / -b -j)
    gh pr create …                         # then on open PR:
    gh pr checks <N>                       # cubic CI
    gh pr view <N> --comments              # CodeRabbit PR prompts
    ```

    **Run every review prompt** from cubic and CodeRabbit on the PR; fix **P0/P1**; resolve threads or document waiver in evidence. Skills: `run-review` · `check-pr-comments` · `coderabbit`.

12. **Evidence Score** — compute + write ledger + update persona file (include cubic + CodeRabbit table)
13. **Sync todo + changelog** — **mandatory after every task** ([`mdeai-launch-changelog.mdc`](./mdeai-launch-changelog.mdc)): append changelog entry, update todo row/checklists/`Last synced:` — before final reply
14. **Linear** — **In Review** with evidence link; **Done** only after user approval

Skip full `npm run floor` for ≤2-file UI slices only when L1–L4 for that slice pass; document in evidence.

