## Deploy gate (prod claims)

Before “post-merge PASS” or Production Score > 0:

```bash
cd /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp
gh pr view <N> --json state,mergedAt,mergeCommit
gh api repos/amo-tech-ai/mdeapp/deployments --jq '.[] | select(.environment=="Production") | {sha:.sha[0:7],created:.created_at}' | head -1
```

**BLOCKED** if PR open or prod SHA ≠ merge commit. Evidence must say **BLOCKED**, not PASS.

