## Anti-patterns (reject)

- Finishing a task without syncing [`mdeapp/todo.md`](../todo.md) + [`mdeapp/changelog.md`](../changelog.md)
- Implementing without Level 0 pre-flight (skills + MCP + blockers table)
- Vitest-only or curl-only proof for chat/maps/cards (no Browser/Playwright/Chrome DevTools)
- Localhost-only proof when prod is deployable (must hit `https://www.mdeai.co/`)
- PR opened without `cubic review` + CodeRabbit comment pass
- Ignoring CodeRabbit/cubic P0/P1 prompts on the PR
- Linear Done without Evidence Score ≥ 90 for P0
- “Post-merge validation” while PR is OPEN
- Hero/browser test with raw `fill()` — use `maps-layout.ts` helpers
- One PR mixing unrelated SAN scopes
- Claiming prod without deploy SHA proof
- Task-centric “tests pass” without persona-visible proof

